1
00:01:00,759 --> 00:01:01,960
Chunmei, let me ask you.

2
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:03,600
Here in the Li manor,

3
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:04,680
have you ever seen a boy?

4
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:07,079
A boy?

5
00:01:07,599 --> 00:01:08,840
What boy?

6
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:11,519
Your master has married three wives.

7
00:01:12,079 --> 00:01:13,159
Did any of them have a boy?

8
00:01:14,239 --> 00:01:14,879
All three wives

9
00:01:15,040 --> 00:01:16,840
died within a month of marrying him.

10
00:01:17,319 --> 00:01:19,040
They didn't leave the master any heirs.

11
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:21,799
Miss Mengzhu was born to his first wife.

12
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:24,000
The master only has one daughter, Miss Mengzhu.

13
00:01:24,599 --> 00:01:26,280
Then that boy must be a ghost!

14
00:01:32,159 --> 00:01:32,920
These pieces of jewelry

15
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:34,680
were left by the previous three wives.

16
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:36,799
See if there are any you like, madam,

17
00:01:37,239 --> 00:01:38,359
to wear during the wedding ceremony.

18
00:01:47,439 --> 00:01:47,840
Look.

19
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:49,640
It seems like the She-devil

20
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:51,359
really wants to marry Master Li.

21
00:01:51,959 --> 00:01:52,560
Master,

22
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:55,959
are you reluctant to let the She-devil marry?

23
00:01:57,439 --> 00:01:58,400
Do you have feelings for her?

24
00:01:58,439 --> 00:01:59,439
Give me a break.

25
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:00,799
Her?

26
00:02:00,959 --> 00:02:02,400
She punches and kicks at the slightest thing.

27
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,079
Whoever marries her

28
00:02:04,319 --> 00:02:05,599
would end up beaten black and blue.

29
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:08,919
With Master Li's frail body,

30
00:02:09,879 --> 00:02:10,800
God help him.

31
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:15,960
I'm done for. I'm done for.

32
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:17,080
It's already 4:00.

33
00:02:17,719 --> 00:02:18,759
There are only three hours left.

34
00:02:19,159 --> 00:02:20,479
Who on earth is the killer?

35
00:02:30,199 --> 00:02:31,479
You like this kingfisher hairpin, madam?

36
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:34,759
Third Madam wore this when she performed.

37
00:02:35,199 --> 00:02:36,879
I heard her ex-husband gave it to her.

38
00:02:37,639 --> 00:02:40,039
Third Madam had an ex-husband?

39
00:02:41,479 --> 00:02:43,319
Two wives died in a row in the Li manor.

40
00:02:43,719 --> 00:02:45,319
Prominent families in town

41
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:47,319
no longer dare to marry their daughters into the Li family.

42
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:49,960
Just when the master was feeling depressed,

43
00:02:50,719 --> 00:02:51,879
he met Third Madam.

44
00:02:57,879 --> 00:02:58,960
Why did you stop singing?

45
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,680
Our master still wants to listen.

46
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:04,599
My husband passed away.

47
00:03:05,759 --> 00:03:07,599
A weak woman like me can't run this place.

48
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:09,960
So I have to close this stage.

49
00:03:11,159 --> 00:03:12,520
I made you two come for nothing.

50
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:14,439
I'm truly sorry.

51
00:03:16,159 --> 00:03:19,479
Are you the Prima Donna, Yumo?

52
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:23,039
Thank you for remembering me, sir.

53
00:03:24,479 --> 00:03:25,439
From now on,

54
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:28,400
I will no longer sing opera.

55
00:03:29,319 --> 00:03:30,080
In this world,

56
00:03:31,319 --> 00:03:32,280
Yumo is no more.

57
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:39,360
Our master loves hearing Miss Yumo sing.

58
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:42,039
Could we invite you to stay at our manor for a while?

59
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:44,560
We hope you can cheer up soon.

60
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:55,199
The master happened to invite her to stay,

61
00:03:55,919 --> 00:03:58,479
and Yumo naturally became Third Madam.

62
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:01,120
The case files state that

63
00:04:01,479 --> 00:04:03,479
Third Madam died of an illness.

64
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:04,319
What illness?

65
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,479
Third Madam didn't get sick.

66
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,360
She was possessed.

67
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:12,360
Possessed?

68
00:04:13,159 --> 00:04:14,840
Third Madam sang opera by the well

69
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:16,360
and got possessed.

70
00:04:19,759 --> 00:04:20,199
Madam.

71
00:04:20,879 --> 00:04:21,439
Madam.

72
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:23,519
Can't we just sing in the courtyard?

73
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:25,120
Do we have to go to that well?

74
00:04:26,639 --> 00:04:27,399
My husband...

75
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:28,639
No.

76
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:32,240
My ex-husband wrote this play on his deathbed.

77
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:33,399
Cinnabar Well.

78
00:04:34,279 --> 00:04:35,680
It's about a resentful woman jumping into a well,

79
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:37,199
and being saved by a general.

80
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,199
So to rehearse this play,

81
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:40,759
we must be by a well.

82
00:04:41,399 --> 00:04:42,360
But this well

83
00:04:42,639 --> 00:04:43,759
is the Dragon-Locking Well!

84
00:04:43,959 --> 00:04:45,240
Under the iron chains at the mouth of this well,

85
00:04:45,519 --> 00:04:47,560
the Dragon King of the East Sea is tied up!

86
00:04:50,959 --> 00:04:52,120
The Dragon King is in this well?

87
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:53,759
Perfect.

88
00:04:54,399 --> 00:04:56,879
I'll invite him to sing with me.

89
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,279
Madam!

90
00:04:58,959 --> 00:05:01,279
Why won't you listen to me?

91
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:06,240
Through the years,

92
00:05:06,519 --> 00:05:10,319
amidst the busy world,

93
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:16,800
the ancient well still pours out its heart.

94
00:05:17,199 --> 00:05:20,600
Cinnabar Well,

95
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:24,199
a love hard to forget,

96
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:31,000
a dream of following each other in life and death.

97
00:05:43,439 --> 00:05:43,920
Madam.

98
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,800
There's nothing here.

99
00:06:15,199 --> 00:06:21,240
Secrets lie within the Cinnabar Well,

100
00:06:22,079 --> 00:06:27,519
its dark waters hold tales of the past.

101
00:06:28,879 --> 00:06:34,399
Who has seen the well builders of yesteryear?

102
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:41,160
Lost shadows bind lonely souls.

103
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:49,439
Madam, you must be tired from singing.

104
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:50,240
Take a rest.

105
00:06:50,959 --> 00:06:52,079
How did I sound this time?

106
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:53,839
You sang beautifully, Madam.

107
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:56,160
Truly a legendary actress and Prima Donna.

108
00:06:56,279 --> 00:06:57,879
Beautiful and talented, simply peerless.

109
00:06:59,079 --> 00:07:00,839
Why isn't the master back yet? It's so late.

110
00:07:01,439 --> 00:07:02,480
We agreed

111
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:03,800
that after I finished singing Cinnabar Well,

112
00:07:03,959 --> 00:07:06,040
we'd go to Cuixiang Restaurant for dinner.

113
00:07:06,759 --> 00:07:07,839
I'll go check on the master.

114
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,279
You rest here for a bit.

115
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:21,639
Madam.

116
00:07:23,959 --> 00:07:24,319
Madam!

117
00:07:24,519 --> 00:07:25,399
Madam, what's wrong?

118
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:27,439
Somebody, help!

119
00:07:27,839 --> 00:07:28,720
Somebody come quickly!

120
00:07:28,839 --> 00:07:29,800
The Dragon King is here.

121
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:31,120
The Dragon King is here, Madam!

122
00:07:31,839 --> 00:07:32,480
Madam!

123
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:34,680
Somebody!

124
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:36,839
Somebody help!

125
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:41,600
Ever since the Dragon King came that day,

126
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:43,879
Third Madam has been delirious.

127
00:07:44,079 --> 00:07:44,800
May the Bodhisattva protect us.

128
00:07:45,399 --> 00:07:46,639
Please let Madam get well soon.

129
00:07:51,399 --> 00:07:52,040
Doctor,

130
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:53,439
what exactly is

131
00:07:54,639 --> 00:07:55,720
wrong with Madam?

132
00:07:56,759 --> 00:07:58,879
It doesn't seem like Madam is sick.

133
00:07:59,040 --> 00:07:59,480
She's...

134
00:08:00,079 --> 00:08:01,040
She's possessed.

135
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:02,800
Possessed?

136
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:05,319
Did she offend an evil spirit?

137
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:06,959
You're right.

138
00:08:09,319 --> 00:08:10,759
The Dragon King fancies me.

139
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:13,199
He wants me to sing opera for him in the Underworld.

140
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,600
Dragon King?

141
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,240
What Dragon King?

142
00:08:17,959 --> 00:08:19,399
Please wake up, Madam!

143
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:21,519
It's... It's the Dragon-Locking Well.

144
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,319
Madam disturbed the Dragon King in the well.

145
00:08:23,639 --> 00:08:25,519
Yes, the Dragon King fancies Madam.

146
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:27,160
The Dragon King said I sing opera beautifully.

147
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,839
He said I sing opera beautifully.

148
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:35,639
Secrets lie within the Cinnabar Well.

149
00:08:36,159 --> 00:08:39,279
Hidden deep within the well.

150
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:43,399
Madam, what's wrong?

151
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:44,639
Madam!

152
00:08:44,919 --> 00:08:45,600
What's wrong?

153
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,120
Doctor, you have to save her!

154
00:08:47,799 --> 00:08:48,159
Madam!

155
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:48,919
Here, Madam.

156
00:08:53,519 --> 00:08:55,039
Poor Third Madam. When she was alive,

157
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:56,679
she loved the master deeply.

158
00:08:57,519 --> 00:08:58,200
After her death,

159
00:08:58,559 --> 00:08:59,559
as soon as night falls,

160
00:08:59,919 --> 00:09:01,399
she comes back looking for the master.

161
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,200
Madam.

162
00:09:35,799 --> 00:09:36,440
Madam.

163
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:37,399
Master.

164
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:40,039
You're back.

165
00:09:45,159 --> 00:09:45,919
Stay back!

166
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:47,480
Help!
